Rule 4 (tensor must have positive shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 7 (tensor has valid shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = v_2[i]
>>
Rule 9 (tensor is not empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 10 (tensor must be 2-dimensional)
